menu "ExecuTorch component consumer"

    config ET_CONSUMER_MODEL
        string "Models to run from ET_CONSUMER_MODELS_DIR"
        default "smoke"
        help
            With ET_CONSUMER_MODELS_DIR, the app runs each model of this
            semicolon-separated list from it: <name>.pte, checked against
            <name>.io. Their kernel bundle is the list's names joined by
            underscores, then _kernels, such as smoke_mul_kernels.

endmenu
